{"id":4325,"date":"2024-09-04T14:20:46","date_gmt":"2024-09-04T12:20:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/venol.de\/?page_id=4325"},"modified":"2024-09-04T14:24:56","modified_gmt":"2024-09-04T12:24:56","slug":"laboratorio","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/venol.de\/es\/empresa\/laboratorio\/","title":{"rendered":"Laboratorio"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id='layer_slider_1'  class='avia-layerslider main_color avia-shadow  avia-builder-el-0  el_before_av_layerslider  avia-builder-el-first  container_wrap fullsize'  style='height: 651px; max-width: 1410px; margin: 0 auto;'  ><\/div>\n<div id='layer_slider_2'  class='avia-layerslider main_color avia-shadow  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_layerslider  el_before_av_textblock  slider-not-first container_wrap fullsize'  style='height: 501px; max-width: 425px; margin: 0 auto;'  ><\/div><div id='after_layer_slider_2'  class='main_color av_default_container_wrap container_wrap fullsize'  ><div class='container av-section-cont-open' ><div class='template-page content  av-content-full alpha units'><div class='post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-4325'><div class='entry-content-wrapper clearfix'>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevn4ey-95dba3fc88288e36bd88a1d8fb540a52 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Laboratorio de investigaci\u00f3n y desarrollo VENOL MOTOR OIL se crea por un equipo joven, creativo y din\u00e1mico. Nuestros empleados son especialistas cualificados y experimentados que ampl\u00edan constantemente sus conocimientos. Sus habilidades, fiabilidad y precisi\u00f3n facilitan aprovechar todo el potencial disponible en las condiciones tecnol\u00f3gicas de nuestro laboratorio. Adem\u00e1s, disponemos de modernos instrumentos de medici\u00f3n que nos permiten realizar pruebas, tales como:<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyew7ngu-e5790f48b07e299f730e5ce5e964ae18\">\n#top .flex_column.av-lyew7ngu-e5790f48b07e299f730e5ce5e964ae18{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n.responsive #top #wrap_all .flex_column.av-lyew7ngu-e5790f48b07e299f730e5ce5e964ae18{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-lyew7ngu-e5790f48b07e299f730e5ce5e964ae18 av_one_third  avia-builder-el-3  el_after_av_textblock  el_before_av_one_third  first flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevoe6q-c4a843a3cf637bde89730a96eb27cf2d '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><ul>\n<li>Viscosidad cinem\u00e1tica,<\/li>\n<li>\u00cdndice de viscosidad (IV),<\/li>\n<li>Viscosidad estructural (CCS),<\/li>\n<li>Punto de fluidez,<\/li>\n<li>Punto de inflamabilidad,<\/li>\n<li>Punto de cristalizaci\u00f3n<\/li>\n<li>Punto de ebullici\u00f3n,<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4\">\n#top .flex_column.av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n.flex_column.av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4{\npadding:0 0 0 0;\n}\n.responsive #top #wrap_all .flex_column.av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4 av_one_third  avia-builder-el-5  el_after_av_one_third  el_before_av_one_third  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevp0he-f7696914e3410086ea0950efe41d1dd6 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><ul>\n<li>Resistencia a la formaci\u00f3n de espuma,<\/li>\n<li>Desemulsificaci\u00f3n,TBN\/TAN,<\/li>\n<li>Corrosi\u00f3n del cobre a 100\u00baC,<\/li>\n<li>Contenido de cenizas sulfatadas,<\/li>\n<li>Control de propiedades a baja temperatura de los aceites (m\u00e9todo propio),<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyewa05b-e6e7bad8caaaa1b588af0cea1b7e13b6\">\n#top .flex_column.av-lyewa05b-e6e7bad8caaaa1b588af0cea1b7e13b6{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n.flex_column.av-lyewa05b-e6e7bad8caaaa1b588af0cea1b7e13b6{\npadding:0 0 0 0;\n}\n.responsive #top #wrap_all .flex_column.av-lyewa05b-e6e7bad8caaaa1b588af0cea1b7e13b6{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-lyewa05b-e6e7bad8caaaa1b588af0cea1b7e13b6 av_one_third  avia-builder-el-7  el_after_av_one_third  el_before_av_one_fourth  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevpoyq-89ea018e480ebaf1d4e424357ad06d19 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><ul>\n<li>Densidad,<\/li>\n<li>pH,<\/li>\n<li>Tensi\u00f3n superficial,<\/li>\n<li>Conductividad el\u00e9ctrica de l\u00edquido,<\/li>\n<li>Prueba de propiedades antidesgaste de lubricantes mediante el probador de evaluaci\u00f3n tribol\u00f3gica de lubricantes seg\u00fan el m\u00e9todo Bruger.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n<div  class='flex_column av-a4uxgx-b65a021b6a29e832cfd89f6bf6791070 av_one_fourth  avia-builder-el-9  el_after_av_one_third  el_before_av_one_fourth  first flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyevyogv-54e89c3d22b87f40c33817506ddb5741\">\n.avia-image-container.av-lyevyogv-54e89c3d22b87f40c33817506ddb5741 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-lyevyogv-54e89c3d22b87f40c33817506ddb5741 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-cont